solarman-bridge (0.1.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: native Solarman V5 / Modbus RTU client,
    Deye SG04LP3 register map, SQLite history with decimated range queries
    and daily energy from the inverter's own counters, HTTP dashboard
    (Realtime / History / Energy / Info) and JSON API on port 8081.

